s=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588002\">〔因〕－【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588002\">因【大】，〔－〕【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588003\">二＝正【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588003\">二【大】，正【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588004\">（若）＋比丘【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588004\">比丘【大】，若比丘【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588005\">尠＝斯【元】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588005\">尠【大】，斯【元】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588006\">芽＝牙【宋】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588006\">芽【大】，牙【宋】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588007\">間＝聞【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588007\">間【大】，聞【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588008\">肢＝技【宋】，枝【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588008\">肢【大】，技【宋】，枝【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588009\">壯＋（若）【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588009\">壯【大】，壯若【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588010\">〔是故〕－【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588010\">是故【大】，〔－〕【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588011\">因＝困【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588011\">因【大】，困【宋】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588012\">遠＝還【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0588012\">遠【大】，還【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589001\">〔空〕－【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589001\">空【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589002\">觀＋（身因）【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589002\">觀【大】，觀身因【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589003\">揣＝摶【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589003\">揣【大】，摶【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589004\">鑽＝𥎞【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589004\">鑽【大】，𥎞【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589005\">矛＝鉾【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589005\">矛【大】，鉾【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589006\">預＝豫【宋】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589006\">預【大】，豫【宋】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589007\">豹＝兕【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589007\">豹【大】，兕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589008\">〔之身〕－【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589008\">之身【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589009\">而＝如【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589009\">而【大】，如【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589010\">香花＝華香【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589010\">香花【大】，華香【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589011\">可＝不【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589011\">可【大】，不【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589c0801\">讎【CB】【麗-CB】，儲【大】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589012\">遶＝擾【宋】【元】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589012\">遶【大】，擾【宋】【元】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589013\">減＝滅【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589013\">減【大】，滅【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589014\">瀑＝暴【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589014\">瀑【大】，暴【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589015\">眴＝瞬【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589015\">眴【大】，瞬【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589016\">惜＝愍【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589016\">惜【大】，愍【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589017\">王＝生【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0589017\">王【大】，生【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590001\">足＝是【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590001\">足【大】，是【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590002\">商＝賈【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590002\">商【大】，賈【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590003\">是＝足【宋】【元】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590003\">是【大】，足【宋】【元】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590004\">即＝則【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590004\">即【大】，則【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590005\">師＝歸【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590005\">師【大】，歸【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590006\">悲＋（愍）【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590006\">悲【大】，悲愍【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590007\">〔沒〕－【三】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590007\">沒【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590008\">憐＝悲【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590008\">憐【大】，悲【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590009\">悲＝愍【三】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590009\">悲【大】，愍【宋】【元】【明】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590010\">不分卷【三】【宮】，（大般涅槃經）＋憍【宋】【元】【宮】</div><div class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0590010\">憍【大】，大般涅槃經憍【宋】【元】【宮】，不分卷【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</div></div>"
